# Copy to `.dev.vars` for `npm run dev`, or let the Deploy to Cloudflare flow ask
# for it (Workers & Pages -> your Worker -> Settings -> Variables and Secrets after
# deploying).
#
# Required, not optional: lookups to api.theintrodb.org are rate limited per IP,
# and every Cloudflare Worker shares Cloudflare's egress addresses, so a Worker
# without its own key is limited by everyone else's traffic. Without a key the
# addon does no lookups at all and passes streams through untouched.
#
# Get a key at https://theintrodb.org/docs
TIDB_API_KEY=
